  "releaseNotes": "## 12.2.3\n\n### Fixes\n- Springloaded formatting now reaches text typed inside an already formatted run. The value was written onto a span wrapping the inserted text, but the inserted text sits in a run split off the surrounding one and keeps its formatting, and a run's own value beats the one on its parent span, so picking a size or colour and typing into formatted text changed nothing. The transfer now clears the property from the wrapped content in the same step.",
